{"id":5216983,"title":"Keep Shabbat & Merit to See Mashiach","hall":"moadim","room":"Passover","date":"2026-03-20","words":103,"lang":"en","source":"https://breslev.com/5216983/","body":"<h2><strong  data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-sfc-cb=\"\" data-complete=\"true\" aria-owns=\"action-menu-parent-container\">A Special Call from Rabbi Arush</strong></h2>\n<div  data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-sfc-cb=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAEIAxAB\" data-complete=\"true\">Two Shabbats to change the world! Rabbi Arush is inviting every Jew to join together in keeping the next two Shabbats—including <strong  data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-sfc-cb=\"\" data-complete=\"true\">Shabbat HaGadol</strong>, the &#8220;Great Shabbat&#8221; right before Passover. </div>\n<h2 data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-hveid=\"CAEIAxAC\" data-complete=\"true\"></h2>\n<div  data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-sfc-cb=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAEIAxAC\" data-complete=\"true\">Think keeping Shabbat is hard? It’s simpler than you think:</div>\n<ul  data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-sfc-cb=\"\" data-complete=\"true\">\n<li  data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-sfc-cb=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAEIAxAD\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sae=\"\"><strong  data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-sfc-cb=\"\" data-complete=\"true\">Prep early:</strong> Get your favorite foods ready before sunset.</li>\n<li  data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-sfc-cb=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAEIAxAD\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sae=\"\"><strong  data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-sfc-cb=\"\" data-complete=\"true\">Unplug:</strong> Turn off the phone and enjoy the quiet.</li>\n<li  data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-sfc-cb=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAEIAxAD\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sae=\"\"><strong  data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-sfc-cb=\"\" data-complete=\"true\">Relax:</strong> Whether you’re singing at the table or napping all afternoon, you’re doing it!</li>\n</ul>\n<h2  data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-hveid=\"CAEIAxAG\" data-complete=\"true\" aria-owns=\"action-menu-parent-container\"><strong  data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-sfc-cb=\"\" data-complete=\"true\">The Blessing</strong></h2>\n<div  data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-sfc-cb=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAEIAxAG\" data-complete=\"true\" aria-owns=\"action-menu-parent-container\">Rabbi Arush offers a special blessing to everyone participating: May you merit to witness the coming of Mashiach, speedily in our days! Amen.</div>\n<div data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-sfc-cb=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAEIAxAG\" data-complete=\"true\" aria-owns=\"action-menu-parent-container\"></div>\n<div data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" data-sfc-cb=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAEIAxAG\" data-complete=\"true\" aria-owns=\"action-menu-parent-container\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\" https://breslev.com/video/5217135/?display=video&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe></div>"}